content:
On a Service Accounts and Repair Orders points redemption, the frequent visit credit follows the account's payment history and tier:
- at least 4 payments received on the account within the last twelve whole months, account at Kessler Owner Rewards Gold or Platinum: 15.00 added;
- at least 4 payments received within the last twelve whole months, account at Kessler Owner Rewards Silver: 8.00 added;
- otherwise nothing is added.

**Window.** A record falls within the last twelve whole months when fewer than twelve whole months separate its date from the redemption date, a whole month being complete on the same day of a later month, or on the first day of the month after it where that month has no such day, so records dated on the redemption date count. Every payment received on the account counts, on any repair order.

**Edges (hypothetical, redemption on 8 July).** Payments dated 9 July of last year, 2 October, 14 February and 8 July: four payments inside the window. A payment dated 8 July of last year is outside it.
